The values is a list of 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5.
The last is the last position of values.
The size is last plus 1.
The target is 2.
The offset is target modulo size.
The result is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every position from 0 to last.
The source is position plus size minus offset.
If source is at least size, set source to source minus size.
Place item source of values into result.

For each value in result, display value.
